{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kabz\u0131mal\u0131n G\u00fcnl\u00fc\u011f\u00fc</strong>, s\u0131radan bir meyve t\u00fcccar\u0131n\u0131n karanl\u0131k bir g\u00fcce d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015fme hik\u00e2yesi. K\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck bir depoda ba\u015flayan yolculuk, pazarda \u00fc\u00e7 kuru\u015f i\u00e7in pazarl\u0131kla ba\u015flar ama zamanla ihale oyunlar\u0131na, medya manip\u00fclasyonlar\u0131na ve devletin zirvesine kadar uzan\u0131r.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her b\u00f6l\u00fcmde yeni bir y\u00fcz takacaks\u0131n:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bir Garip Kabz\u0131mal</strong>: M\u00fc\u015fteriye mal\u0131n\u0131 sat, vergilerden ka\u00e7, g\u00fcn\u00fc kurtar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Karanl\u0131k Efendi</strong>: Mafyayla anla\u015f, rakiplerini bat\u0131r, iktidar\u0131 zorla.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kara Y\u00fcce</strong>: Devleti y\u00f6net, paray\u0131 kendi kasana ak\u0131t, taht\u0131n\u0131 koru.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00d6ne \u00c7\u0131kanlar</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pazarl\u0131k yap, fiyatlar\u0131 belirle, m\u00fc\u015fterileri ikna et.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Se\u00e7imlerin kal\u0131c\u0131, hatalar\u0131n affedilmez.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her oyunda farkl\u0131 olaylar, s\u00fcrpriz sonu\u00e7lar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cG\u00fc\u00e7 mutlak yozla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r\u201d temas\u0131n\u0131 bizzat ya\u015fa.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538450?t=1759093329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538450/24e7ba46800764e84c76cba7bce6db1677664bfc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759093329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538450/60b24482453b53a213d589feeda6b00a83dcf0a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=17590